# TIER 1 - GFN2-xTB optimization + frequency (local laptop)
# Requires the xtb interface: install xtb (conda: conda install -c conda-forge xtb)
# Atom numbering inside ORCA blocks is ZERO-based.
# line 1: keywords. line 2: parallel cores = 3 on the laptop (keep 1 core free).

! XTB2 OPT FREQ

%pal nprocs 3 end

* xyzfile 0 1 input.xyz
